You had another option - paying Sam off.  Not a good idea if he is
close to you, but if you had teleported him away, you could drop your
unpaid items, take out some gold, and pay until he forgives you.

Sam is so tough, you can't really expect your pet to be able to kill
him.  Even a pet Solar can get decapitated by him.  Fortunately, there
are many ways to steal from him relatively safely.

